\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
We must know the present need of human society. And what is that need? Human society is no longer bounded by geographical limits to particular countries or communities. Human society is broader than in the Middle Ages, and the world tendency is toward one
 state or one human society. The ideals of spiritual communism, according to }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
are based more or less on the oneness of the entire human society, nay, on the entire energy of living beings. The need is felt by great thinkers to make this a successful ideology. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4
gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 will fill this need in human society. It begins, therefore, with the aphorism of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
philosophy }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (janm\'e4dy asya yata\'f9) }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 to establish the ideal of a common cause.
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Human society, at the present moment, is not in the darkness of oblivion. It has made rapid progress in the field of material comforts, education 
and economic development throughout the entire world. But there is a pinprick somehwere in the social body at large, and therefore there are large-scale quarrels, even over less important issues. There is need of a clue as to how humanity can become one i
n peace, friendship and prosperity with a common cause. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
will fill this need, for it is a cultural presentation for the re-spiritualization of the entire human society.
\par }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 should be introduced also in the schools and colle
ges, for it is recommended by the great student devotee Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja in order to change the demonic face of society.
\par }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 kaum\'e4ra \'e4caret pr\'e4j\'efo dharm\'e4n bh\'e4gavat\'e4n iha
\par durlabha\'e0 m\'e4nu\'f1a\'e0 janma tad apy adhruvam arthadam
\par                                                                                               (Bh\'e4g. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 7.6.1)
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Disparity in human society is due to lack of principles in a godless civilization. There is God, or the Almighty One, from whom everything emanates, by whom everything is maintained and
 in whom everything is merged to rest. Material science has tried to find the ultimate source of creation very insufficiently, but it is a fact that there is one ultimate source of everything that be. This ultimate source is explained rationally and autho
ritatively in the beautiful }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam.}{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is the transcendental science not only for knowing the ultimate source of everything but also for knowing our relation with Him and our duty towards perfection of the human so
ciety on the basis of this perfect knowledge. It is powerful reading matter in the Sanskrit language, and it is now rendered into English elaborately so that simply by a careful reading one will know God perfectly well, so much so that the reader will be 
sufficiently educated to defend himself from the onslaught of atheists. Over and above this, the reader will be able to convert others to accept God as a concrete principle.
\par }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 begins with the definition of the ultimate source. It is a bona fide commentary on the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 by the same author, \'c7r\'e9la Vy\'e4
sadeva, and gradually it develops into nine cantos up to .the highest state of God realization. The only qualification one needs to study this great book of transcendental knowledge is to 
proceed step by step cautiously and not jump forward haphazardly like with an ordinary book. It should be gone through chapter by chapter, one after another. The reading matter is so arranged with its original Sanskrit text, its English transliteration, ,
 translation and purports so that one is sure to become a God realized soul at the end of finishing the first nine cantos.
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The Tenth Canto is distinct from the first nine cantos, because it deals directly with the transcendental activities of the Personality of Godhead \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. One will be unable to capture the effects of the Tenth Canto without going through the first nine cantos. The book is complete in twelve cantos, each independent, but it is good for all to read them in small installments one after another.
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541    }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 I must admit my frailties in presenting }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
but still I am hopeful of its good reception by the thinkers and leaders of society on the strength of the following statement of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam.
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541 tad-v\'e4g}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 visargo janat\'e4gha-viplavo
\par }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid7089541 yasmin prati}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7lokam abaddhavaty api
\par n\'e4m\'e4ny anantasya ya\'e7o '\'eckit\'e4ni yac
\par ch\'e5\'ebvanti g\'e4yanti g\'e5\'ebanti s\'e4dhava\'f9
\par                                                                                    (Bh\'e4g. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 1.5.11)
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 "On the other hand, that literature which is full wit
h descriptions of the transcendental glories of the name, fame, form and pastimes of the unlimited Supreme Lord is a transcendental creation meant to bring about a revolution in the impious life of a misdirected civilization. Such transcendental literatur
es, even though irregularly composed, are heard, sung and accepted by purified men who are thoroughly honest." 
\par 
