\par So the Lord advented Himself on the }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid14297723 Ph\'e4lguni}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  P\'fcr\'ebim\'e4 evening of 1407 }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid14297723\charrsid14297723 \'c7akabda}{
