and it was by the will of the Lord that there was a lunar eclipse on that evening. During the hours of eclipse it was the custom of the Hindu public to take bath in the Ganges or any other sacred river and chant the Vedic }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mantras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 for purification. When Lord Caitanya was born during the lunar eclipse, all India was roaring with the holy sound of }{
