use of the words }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhav\'e4n\'e9-bhartu\'f9. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 He pointed out that the use of these two words was redundant. Bhav\'e4n\'e9}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 means the wife of \'c7iva, and who else can be her }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhart\'e4, }{
