\par Upon this, the Lord spoke as follows: "My dear sir, I can understand the meaning of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 s\'fctras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 like }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
