\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 fashionably, according to their limited power of thinking, to serve their own purpose. Such indirect interpretations of the authentic literatures like the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved
\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are hereby condemned by the Lord.
\par The Lord continued: "\'c7r\'e9la Vy\'e4sadeva has summarized the direct meanings of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mantras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
