\par "The authority of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is unchallengeable and stands without any question of doubt. And whatever is stated in the }{
