is as dazzling as the midday sun, and when someone tries to give his own interpretations on the self-effulgent sunlike }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
he attempts to cover this sun with the cloud of his imagination.
\par "The purpose of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Pur\'e4\'ebas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
