movement, which was in his opinion nothing but religious sentiment. Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4nanda was a profound student of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and he advised his foll
owers to give attention to the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and not to indulge in }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sa\'eck\'e9rtana.
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 One devotee }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 br\'e4hma\'eba, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 who became a devotee of the Lord, did not like the criticism of Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4
nanda, and he went to the Lord to express his regrets. He told the Lord that when he uttered the Lord's name before the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4
nanda, the latter strongly criticized Him, although he heard him uttering several times the name Caitanya. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 br\'e4hma\'eba }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 was astonished to see that the 
}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4nanda could not vibrate the sound K\'e5\'f1\'eba even once, although he uttered the name Caitanya several times.
\par The Lord smilingly explained to the devotee }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 br\'e4hma\'eba }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 why the M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 cannot utter the holy name of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. "The M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d
\'e9s are offenders at the lotus feet of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, although they utter always }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid14297723\charrsid14297723 Brahma}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1186441 n}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 , \'c4tm\'e4, }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Caitanya, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 etc. And because they are offenders at the lotus feet of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, they are actually unable to utter the holy name of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The name K\'e5\'f1\'eba and the Personality of Godhead K\'e5\'f1\'eba are identical. There is no difference in the absolute real
m between the name, form or person of the Absolute Truth because in the absolute realm everything is transcendental bliss. There is no difference between the body and the soul for the Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. Thus He is different from the living entity who is always different from his outward body. Because of K\'e5\'f1\'eba's transcendental position, it is very difficult for a layman to actually know the Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, His holy name and fame, etc. His name, fame, form and pastimes all are one and the same transcendental identity, and they are not knowable by the exercise of the material senses.
\par "The transcendental relationship of the pastimes of the Lord is the source of still more bliss than one can experience by realization of }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid14297723\charrsid9851517 Brahma}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1186441 n}{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  or by becoming one with the Supreme. Had it not been so, then those who are already situated in the transcendental bliss of }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid14297723\charrsid5114256 Brahma}{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1186441 n}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  would not have been attracted by the transcendental bliss of the pastimes of the Lord."
\par After this, a great meeting was arranged by the devotees of the Lord in which all the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9s }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 were invited, including the Lord and Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4
nanda Sarasvat\'e9. In this meeting both the scholars (the Lord and Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4nanda) had a long discourse on the spiritual values of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sa\'eck\'e9rtana }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 movement, and a summary is given below.
\par The great M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Prak\'e4\'e7\'e4nanda inquired from the Lord as to the reason for His preferring the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sa\'eck\'e9rtana }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 movement to the study of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 He said that it is the duty of a }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 to read the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 What caused Him to indulge in }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sa\'eck\'e9rtana?
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 After this inquiry, the Lord submissively replied: "I have taken to the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sa\'eck\'e9rtana }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
movement instead of the study of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 because I am a great fool." The Lord thus represented Himself as one of the numberless foo
ls of this age who are absolutely incapable of studying the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 philosophy. The fools' indulgence in the study of }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 has caused so much havoc in society. The Lord thus continued: "And because I am a great fool, My spiritual master forbade Me to play with }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 philosophy. He said that it is better that I chant the holy name of the Lord, for that would deliver Me from material bondage.
\par "In this age of Kali there is no other religion but the glorification of the Lord by utterance of His holy name, and that is the injunction of all the revealed scriptures. And My spiritual master has taught Me one }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7loka }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (from the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 B\'e5han-N\'e4rad\'e9ya Pur\'e4\'eba) }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
which is:
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5114256 {\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 harer n\'e4ma harer n\'e4ma harer n\'e4maiva kevalam}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid5114256 
