\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Unless one surrenders unto the lotus feet of the Supreme Lord, it is certain that he will be bewildered. When an intelligent man surrenders unto the lotus feet of K\'e5\'f1\'eba and knows completely that K
\'e5\'f1\'eba is the cause of all causes, as confirmed in }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 then only can such an intelligent man become a }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mah\'e4tm\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or great soul. But such a great soul is rarely seen. Only the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mah\'e4tm\'e4s }{
