\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the Absolute Truth is to be known, so the questions of the sages of Naimi\'f1\'e4ra\'ebya are proper and just because they pertain to K\'e5\'f1\'eba, who is the Supreme Per
sonality of Godhead, the Absolute Truth. In }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the Personality of Godhead says that in all the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 there is nothing but the urge for searching after Him, Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba (Bg. 15.15). Thus the questions that pertain to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a are the sum and substance of all the Vedic inquiries.
\par The whole world is full of questions and answers. The birds, beasts and men are all busy in the matter of perpetual questions and answers. In the morning the birds in the nest become busy with questions and answers, and in the
 evening also the same birds come back and again become busy with questions and answers. The human being, unless he is fast asleep at night, is busy with questions and answers. The businessmen in the market are busy with questions and answers, and so also
 
the lawyers in the court and the students in the schools and colleges. The legislators in the parliament are also busy with questions and answers, and the politicians and the press representatives are all busy with questions and answers. Although they go 
on making such questions and answers for their whole lives, they are not at all satisfied. Satisfaction of the soul can only be obtained by questions and answers on the subject of K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par K\'e5\'f1\'eba is our most intimate master, friend, father or son and object of conjugal love. Forgetting K\'e5\'f1\'eba, we have created so many objects of questions and answers, but none of them are able to give us complete satisfaction. All things
\emdash but K\'e5\'f1\'eba\emdash give temporary satisfaction only, so if we are to have complete satisfaction we must take to the questions and answers about K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. We cannot live for a moment without being questioned or without giving answers. Because the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
deals with questions and answers that are related to K\'e5\'f1\'eba, we can derive the highest satisfaction only by reading and hearing this transcendental literature. One should learn the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh
\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and make an all-around solution to all problems pertaining to social, political or religious matters. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and K\'e5\'f1\'eba are the sum total of all things.
\par }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
