\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The supreme occupation [dharma] for all humanity is that by which men can attain to loving devotional service unto the
 transcendent Lord. Such devotional service must be unmotivated and uninterrupted in order to completely satisfy the self.
\par }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1786022 
