 is the topmost of all transcendental activities, and therefore it is simultaneously sublime and easy. It is sublime for the pure devotees who are serious about getting in contact with the Supreme Lord, and it is easy for the neophytes who are just on the
 threshold of the house of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhakti. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 It is a great science to achieve the contact of the Supreme Personality of Godhead \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, and it is open for all living beings, including the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7\'fcdras}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 , }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 vai\'e7yas, }{
