\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1186441\charrsid1186441 Brahman}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  or Param\'e4tm\'e4 realization of the Absolute Truth is but a partial realization. There are four different types of living beings, the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 karm\'e9s, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the }{
