der to learn the instructions of devotional service. Such a personality of devotee is not a professional man who earns his livelihood by the business of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatam. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Such a devotee must be a representative of \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9, like S\'fcta Gosv\'e4m\'e9, and must pr
each the cult of devotional service for the all-around benefit of all people. A neophyte devotee has very little taste for hearing from the authorities. Such a neophyte devotee makes a show of hearing from the professional man to satisfy his senses. This 
sort of hearing and chanting has spoiled the whole thing, so one should be very careful about the faulty process. The holy messages of Godhead, as inculcated in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are undoubtedly transcendental subjects, but even
 though they are so, such transcendental matters are not to be received from the professional man who spoils them like the serpent spoils the milk simply by the touch of his tongue.
\par A sincere devotee must, therefore, be prepared to bear the Vedic literature like the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Upani\'f1ads, Ved\'e4nta }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
and other literatures left by the previous authorities or Gosv\'e4m\'e9s, for the benefit of his progress. Without hearing such literatures, one cannot make actual progress. And without hearing and following the instructions, the sh
ow of devotional service becomes worthless and therefore a sort of disturbance in the path of devotional service. Unless, therefore, devotional service is established on the principles of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid13896163 \'e7ruti, sm\'e5ti, p}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 ur\'e4\'eba }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 pa\'efcar\'e4tra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
authorities, the make-show of dev
otional service should at once be rejected. An unauthorized devotee should never be recognized as a pure devotee. By assimilation of such messages from the Vedic literatures, one can see the all-pervading localized aspect of the Personality of Godhead wit
hin his own self constantly- This is called }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sam\'e4dhi.
