The spiritual spark contacted with material elements creates a knot which must be cut if one wants to be liberated from the actions and reactions of fruitive work. Liberation means freedom from the cycle of reactionary work. This liberation automatically 
follows for one who constantly remembers the transcendental pastimes of the Personality of Godhead. This is because all activities of the Supreme Lord (His }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 l\'e9l\'e4) }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are transcendental to the modes of the material energy. They are all-attractive spiritual activ
ities, and therefore constant association with the spiritual activities of the Supreme Lord gradually spiritualizes the conditioned soul and ultimately severs the knot of material bondage.
\par Liberation from material bondage is, therefore, a by-product of dev
otional service. Attainment of spiritual knowledge is not sufficient to insure liberation. Such knowledge must be overcoated with devotional service so that ultimately the devotional service alone predominates. Then liberation is made possible. Even the r
eactionary work of the fruitive workers can lead one to liberation when it is overcoated with devotional service. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Karma }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
overcoated with devotional service is called }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 karma-yoga. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Similarly, empirical knowledge overcoated with devotional service is called }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 j\'ef\'e4na-yoga. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 But pure }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhakti-yoga }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is independent of such }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 karma }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 j\'ef\'e4na }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
because it alone can not only endow one with liberation from the conditional life but can also award one with the transcendental loving service of the Lord.
\par Therefore, any sensible man who
 is above the average man with a poor fund of knowledge must constantly remember the Personality of Godhead by hearing- about Him, by glorifying Him, by remembering Him and by worshiping Him always, without cessation. That is the perfect way of devotional
 service. The Gosv\'e4m\'e9s of V\'e5nd\'e4vana who were authorized by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu to preach the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhakti }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
cult, rigidly followed this rule and made immense literatures of transcendental science for our benefit. They have chalked out ways for all classes of men in terms of the different castes and orders of life in pursuance of the teachings of }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and similar other authoritative scriptures.
