acles in the path of self-realization. The remedy is the association of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 There are two types of }{
