{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavata. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Both the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
are competent remedies, and both of them or either of them can be good enough to eliminate the obstacles. A devotee }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavata }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is as good as the book }{
