gavatas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 And to understand these effects practically, it should be noted that by such sincere association of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatas }{
