\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and the combination of these two }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 will help the neophyte devotee to make progress on and on.

