\'ebu-tattva, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or the Lordship of Godhead. From \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the next manifestation is Baladeva. From Baladeva is Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, from Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba is N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, from N\'e4r
\'e4ya\'eba there is the second Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba, and from this Sa\'eckar\'f1a\'eba the Vi\'f1\'ebu }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 puru\'f1a-avat\'e4ras. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The Vi\'f1\'eb
u or the Deity of the quality of goodness in the material world is the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 puru\'f1a-avat\'e4ra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 known as K\'f1\'e9rodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu or Param\'e4tm
