iva of ignorance. They are the three departmental heads of the three qualities of this material world. Creation is made possible by the goodness of Vi\'f1\'ebu, and when it is required to be destroyed, Lord \'c7iva does it by }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 t\'e4\'eb\'f2ava-n\'e5tya. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The materialists and the foolish human beings worship Brahm\'e4 and \'c7
iva respectively. But the pure transcendentalists worship the form of goodness, Vi\'f1\'ebu, in His various integrated forms and separated forms. The integrated forms are called Godhead, and the separated forms are called the living entities or the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 j\'e9vas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Both the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 j\'e9vas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
and Godhead have their original spiritual forms. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 J\'e9vas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are sometimes subjected to the control of material energy, but the Vi\'f1\'eb
u forms are always controllers of energy. When Vi\'f1\'ebu, the Personality of Godhead, appears in the material world, He comes to deliver the conditioned living beings who are under the material energy. Such living beings appea
r in the material world with intentions of being lords, and thus they become entrapped by the three modes of nature. As such, the living entities have to change the material coverings for undergoing different terms of imprisonment. The prison house of the
 material world is created by Brahm\'e4 under instruction of the Personality of Godhead, and at the conclusion of a }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 kalpa }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the whole thing is destroyed by 
\'c7iva. But as far as maintenance of the prison house is concerned, it is done by Vi\'f1\'ebu, as much as the stat
e prison house is maintained by the state. Anyone, therefore, who wishes to get out of this prison house of material existence, which is full of miseries like repetition of birth, death, disease and old age, must please Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u for such liberation. Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu is worshiped by devotional service only, and if anyone has to continue prison life in the material world, he may ask for relative facilities from the different demigods like \'c7iva, Brahm\'e4, Indra, Varu\'eb
a, etc., for temporary relief. No demigod can, however, release the imprisoned living being from the conditioned life of material existence except Vi\'f1\'ebu. Therefore, the ultimate benefit may be derived from Vi\'f1\'ebu, the Personality of Godhead.

