are equally powerful living beings like the original form of the Personality of Godhead, and they display only different categories of power in consideration of different times and circumstances. The separated p
arts and parcels are powerful by limitation. They do not have unlimited power like the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vi\'f1\'ebu-tattvas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Therefore, the }{
