\par The separated parts and parcels have different positions in the estimation of material powers, and some of them are like K\'e4labhairava}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid204951 , \'c7ma\'e7\'e4h}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 a-bhairava, \'c7ani, Mah
\'e4k\'e4l\'e9, Ca\'eb\'f2ik\'e4. These demigods are worshiped mostly by those who are in the lowest categories of the mode of darkness or ignorance, and there are others who are in the mode of passion and worship demigods like Brahm\'e4, \'c7iva, S\'fc
rya, Ga\'ebe\'e7a and many similar deities, urged by the desire for material enjoyment. But those who are actually situated in the mode of goodness }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (sattva-gu\'eba) }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 of material nature worship only }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vi\'f1\'ebu-tattvas. Vi\'f1\'ebu-tattvas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
