\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
The society of human beings is naturally divided into eight by orders and statuses of life, the four divisions of occupation and four divisions of cultural advancement. The intelligent class, the administrative class,
 the productive class and the laborer class are the four divisions of occupation. And the student life, the householder's life, retired life and renounced life are the four statuses of cultural advancement towards the path of spiritual realization. Out of
 these, the renounced order of life, or the order of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4sa, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is considered the highest of all, and a }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
sanny\'e4s\'e9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is constitutionally the spiritual master for all the orders and divisions. In the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4sa }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
order also there are four stages of upliftment toward perfection. Such stages are called the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 ku\'f6\'e9caka, bah\'fcdaka, parivr\'e4jak\'e4c\'e4rya, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and the 
}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 paramaha\'e0sa. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 paramaha\'e0sa }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
stage of life is the highest stage of perfection. This order of life is respected by all others. Mah\'e4r\'e4ja \'c5\'f1abha, the son of King N\'e4bhi and Merudev\'e9
, was an incarnation of the Lord, and He instructed His sons to follow the path of perfection by }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 tapasya }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
which sanctifies one's existence and enables one to attain the stage of spiritual happiness which is eternal and ever increasing. Every living be
ing is searching after happiness, but no one knows where eternal and unlimited happiness is obtainable. Foolish men seek after material sense pleasure as a substitute for real happiness, but such foolish men forget that temporary so-called happiness deriv
e
d from sense pleasures is also enjoyed by the dogs and hogs. No animal, bird or beast is bereft of this sense pleasure. In every species of life, including the human form of life, such happiness is immensely obtainable. The human form of life is, however,
 not meant for such cheap happiness. The human life is meant for attaining eternal and unlimited happiness by spiritual realization. This spiritual realization is obtained by }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 tapasya }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or undergoing voluntarily the path of penance and abstinence from material pleasures. Those who have been trained for abstinence in material pleasures are called }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 dh\'e9ra, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or men undisturbed by the senses. These }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 dh\'e9ras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
can accept the orders of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4sa, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and they can gradually rise up to the status of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 paramaha\'e0sa, }
{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 which is adored by all members of the society. King \'c5\'f1
abha propagated this mission, and at the last stage He became completely aloof from the material bodily needs, which is a rare stage not to be imitated by foolish men, but to be wor shiped by all.
\par 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7233742 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 TEXT 14
