\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Lord Buddha, a powerful incarnation of the Personality of Godhead, appeared in the province of Gay\'e4 (Bihar) as the son of A\'ef
jana, and he preached his own conception of nonviolence and deprecated even the animal sacrifices sanctioned in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
At the time when Lord Buddha appeared, the p
eople in general were atheistic and preferred animal flesh to anything else. On the plea of Vedic sacrifice, every place was practically turned into a slaughterhouse, and animal killing was indulged in unrestrictedly. Lord Buddha preached nonviolence, tak
ing pity on the poor animals. He preached that he did not believe in the tenets of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
and stressed the adverse psychological effects incurred by animal killing. Less intelligent men of the age of Kali, who had no faith in God, followed his principle,
 and for the time being they were trained in moral discipline and nonviolence, the preliminary steps for proceeding further on the path of God realization. He deluded the atheists because such atheists who followed his principles did not believe in God, b
ut they kept their absolute faith in Lord Buddha who himself was the incarnation of God. Thus the faithless people were made to believe in God in the form of Lord Buddha. That was the mercy of Lord Buddha: He made the faithless faithful to him.
\par Killing of animals before the advent of Lord Buddha was the most prominent feature of the society. They claimed that these were Vedic sacrifices. When the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are not accepted through the authoritative disciplic succession, the casual readers of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are misled
 by the flowery language of that system of knowledge. In the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
a comment has been made on such foolish scholars. The foolish scholars of Vedic literature who do not care to receive the transcendental message through the transcendental realized 
sources of disciplic succession are sure to be bewildered. To them, the ritualistic ceremonies are considered to be all in all. They have no depth of knowledge, according to the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The whole system of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is to lead one gradually to the p
ath of the Supreme Lord. The whole theme of Vedic literature is to know the Supreme Lord, the individual soul, the cosmic situation and the relations between all these items. When the relation is known, the relative function begins, and as a result of suc
h a function the ultimate goal of life or going back to Godhead takes place in the easiest manner. Unfortunately, unauthorized scholars of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
become captivated by the purificatory ceremonies only, and natural progress is checked thereby.
\par To such bewildered persons of atheistic propensity, Lord Buddha is the emblem of theism. He therefore first of all wanted to check the habit of animal killing. The animal killers are dangerous elements on the path of going back to Godhead. There are two t
ypes of animal killers. The soul is also sometimes called the "animal" or the living being. Therefore, both the slaughterer of animals as well as those who have lost their identity of soul are animal killers.
\par Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it said that only the animal killer cannot relish the transcendental message of the Supreme Lord. Therefore if people are to be educated to the path of Godhead they must be taught first and foremost to }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 stop the process of animal killing }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 as above mentioned. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 It is nonsensical to say that an
imal killing has nothing to do with spiritual realization. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 By this dangerous theory many so-called }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9s }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 have sprung up by the grace of Kali-yuga who preach animal killing under the garb of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
The subject matter has already been discussed in the conversation between Lord Caitanya and Maulana Chand Kazi Shaheb. The animal sacrifice as stated in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is different from the unrestricted animal killing in the slaughterhouse. Because the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 asuras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or the so-call
ed scholars of Vedic literatures put forward the evidence of animal killing in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Lord Buddha superficially denied the authority of the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 This rejection of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
by Lord Buddha was adopted in order to save people from the vice of animal killing as well as to save the poor animals from the slaughtering process of their big brothers who }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid163665 clamor for universal brother}{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 hood, peace, justice and equity. There is no justice when there is animal killing. Lord Buddha wanted to stop it completely, and therefore his cult of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 ahi\'e0s
\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 was propagated not only in India but also outside the country.
\par Technically Lord Buddha's philosophy is called atheistic because there is no acceptance of the Supreme Lord and because that system of philosophy denied the authority of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
But that is an act of camouflage by the Lord. Lord Buddha is the incarnation of Godhead. As such, he is the original propounder of Vedic knowledge. He therefore cannot reject Vedic philosophy. But he rejected it outwardly because the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sura-dvi\'f1a, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or the demons who are always envious of the devotees of Godhead, try to support cow killing or animal killing from the pages of the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and this is now being done by the modernized }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4s\'e9s. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Lord Buddha had to reject the authority of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 al
together. This is simply technical, and had it not been so he would not have been so accepted as the incarnation of Godhead. Neither would he have been worshiped in the transcendental songs of the poet Jayadeva, who is a Vai\'f1\'ebava }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e4c\'e4rya. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 He preached the preliminary principles of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 in a manner suitable for the time being (and so also did }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid163665\charrsid163665 \'c4c\'e4rya}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid13256192 \'c7a\'eckar
\'e4c\'e4rya}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 ) to establish the authority of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Therefore both Lord Buddha and }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid163665\charrsid163665 \'c4c\'e4rya}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  \'c7a\'eckara paved the path of theism, and Vai\'f1\'ebava }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e4c\'e4ryas, }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 specifically Lord \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu, led the people on the path towards a realization of going back to Godhead.
\par We are glad that people are taking interest in the nonviolent movement of Lord Buddha. But will they take the matter very seriously and close the animal slaughterhouses altogether? If not, there is no meaning to the}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  ahi\'e0s\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 cult.}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 was composed just prior to the beginning of the age of Kali (about five thousand years ago), and Lord Buddha appeared about 2,600 years ago. Therefore in the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
Lord Buddha is foretold. Such is the authority of this clear scripture. There are many such prophecies, and they are being fulfilled one after another. They will indicate the positive standing of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9
mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 which is without }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 trace of mistake, illusion, cheating and imperfection, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
which are the four flaws of all conditioned souls. The liberated souls are above these flaws; therefore they can see and foretell things which are to take place on distant future dates.
