\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15406109 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 'PURPORT
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9 Vy\'e4
sadeva is the editor of all descriptions of the Vedic literatures, and thus he has described transcendental realization in different ways, namely by fruitive activities, specualtive knowledge, mystic power and devotional service. Besides that, in his va
rious }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Pur\'e4\'ebas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
he has recommended the worship of so many demigods in different forms and names. The result is that people in general are puzzled how to fix up their minds in the service of the Lord; they are always disturbed to find out the real path of sel
f-realization. \'c7r\'e9la N\'e4radadeva is stressing this particular defect in the Vedic literatures compiled by Vy\'e4
sadeva, and thus he is trying to emphasize describing everything in relation with the Supreme Lord, and no one else. In fact, there is nothing exist
ent except the Lord. The Lord is manifested in different expansions. He is the root of the complete tree. He is the stomach of the complete body. As such, pouring water on the root is the right process to water the tree, as much as feeding the stomach sup
plies energy to all the parts of the body. \'c7r\'e9la Vy\'e4sadeva should not have compiled any }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Pur\'e4\'ebas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 other than the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavata Pur\'e4\'eba }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 because a slight deviation from that may create havoc for self-realization. If a slight deviation can create such havoc, then wha
t to speak of deliberate expansion of the separatist idea from the Absolute Truth Personality of Godhead. The most defective part of worshiping demigods is that it creates a definite conception of pantheism, ending disastrously in many religious sects det
rimental to the progress of the principles of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatam, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
which alone can give the accurate direction for self-realization in eternal relation with the Personality of Godhead by devotional service in transcendental love. The example of the boat disturbe
d by whirling wind is suitable in this respect. The diverted mind of the pantheist can never reach to the perfection of self-realization due to the disturbed condition of the selection of object.
\par 
