rience that there is nothing except the Supreme }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid1186441\charrsid1186441 Brahman}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 . The Vedic }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mantra }{
