\par This is a Vedic hymn or }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 mantra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 beginning with }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 omk\'e4ra pra\'ebava, }{
