 has therefore explained the nature of unalloyed devotional service by his personal experience in the development of intimacy between the Lord and the living entity by gradual process of progressive devotional ac
tivities. Such a progressive march of transcendental devotion for the Lord culminates in the attainment of loving service of the Lord, which is called }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 prema }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
in different transcendental variegatedness called }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 rasas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (tastes). Such devotional service is also e
xecuted in mixed forms, namely mixed with fruitive work or empiric philosophical speculations.
