 had already attained that stage, and still he was attracted to undergo the trouble of studying the great }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 literature. This means that }{
