\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 soon as}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 there is}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 nothing to possess}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 . }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Therefore a living being cannot be}{
