\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 of the term, a}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 renouncer. A living being}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 renounces something for gaining something more valuable. A student sacrifices his}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{
