\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 better job. Similarly, a}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 devotee renounces the}{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 material world not for nothing but for something tangible in spiritual value. \'c7r\'e9la}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 and San\'e4tana Gosv\'e4m\'e9 and \'c7r\'e9la}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Raghun\'e4tha Gosv\'e4m\'e9
 and others gave up their worldly pomp and prosperity for the sake of}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the service of the Lord. They were big men in the worldly sense. The Gosv\'e4m\'e9
s were ministers in the government service of Bengal, and \'c7r\'e9la}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 D\'e4sa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 was the son of a big }{
