a, those who continuously hear, chant and repeat Your transcendental activities, or take pleasure in others' doing so, certainly see Your lotus feet, which alone can stop the repetition of birth and death.
\par }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3567724 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 PURPORT}{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12326592 {\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The Supreme Lord \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a cannot be seen by our present conditional vision. In order to see Him, the present vision has to be changed by developing a different condition of life full of spontaneous love of Godhead. When \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a was personally present on the face of the globe, not everyone could see Him as the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par Materialists like R\'e4va\'eba, Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu, Ka\'e0sa, Jar\'e4sandha, \'c7i\'e7up\'e4la, etc., were highly qualified personalities by acqu
isition of material assets, but they were unable to appreciate the presence of the Lord. Therefore, even though the Lord may be present before our eyes, it is not possible to see Him unless we have the necessary vision. This necessary qualification is dev
eloped by the process of devotional service only, beginning with hearing about the Lord from the right sources. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is one of the popular literatures which is generally heard, chanted, repeated, etc., by the people in general, but in spite of 
such hearing, etc., sometimes it is experienced that the performer of such devotional service does not see the Lord eye to eye. The reason is that the first item, }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7rava\'eba, }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is very important. If hearing is from the right sources, it acts very quickly. Gener
ally people hear from unauthorized persons. Such unauthorized persons may be very learned by academic qualifications, but because they do not follow the principles of devotional service, hearing from them becomes a sheer waste of time. Sometimes the texts
 
are interpreted fashionably to suit their own purposes. Therefore, first one should select a competent and bona fide speaker and then hear from him. When the hearing process is perfect and complete, the other processes become automatically perfect in thei
r own way.
\par There are different transcendental activities of the Lord, and each and every one of them is competent to bestow the desired result, provided the hearing process is perfect. In the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bh\'e4gavatam }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 the activities of the Lord begin from His dealings with the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas. There are many other pastimes of the Lord in connection with His dealings with the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 asuras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and others. And in the Tenth Canto the sublime dealing with His conjugal associates the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 gop\'e9s, }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 as well as with His married wives at Dv\'e4rak\'e4
, are mentioned. Since the Lord is absolute, there is no difference in the transcendental nature of each and every dealing of the Lord. But sometimes people, in an unauthorized hearing process, take more interest in hearing about His dealings with the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 gop\'e9s. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
Such an inclination indicates the lusty feelings of the hearer, so a bona fide speaker of the dealings of the Lord never indulges in such hearings. One must hear about the Lord from the very beginning, as in the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
or any other scriptures, and that will help the hearer attain perfection by progressive development. One should not, therefore, consider that His dealings with the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas are less important than His dealings with the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 gop\'e9s. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 We must always remember that the Lord is always transcendental to all mundane attachment. In all the above-mentioned dealings of the Lor}{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid3567724 d, He is the hero in all circum}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 stances, and hearing about Him or about His devotees or combatants is conducive to spiritual life. It is said that the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Vedas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Pur\'e4\'ebas, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
etc., are all made to revive our lost relation with Him. Hearing of all these scriptures is essential.
