f the Queen is to try to persuade the Lord to stay with them. After the Battle of Kuruk\'f1etra, although the inimical kings were killed, their sons and grandsons were still there to deal with the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas. It is not only the P\'e4\'eb\'f2
