ion and thus act accordingly to get free from material bondage or conditional life. In almost all the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Pur\'e4\'ebas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
the subject matter is described in the same spirit, and so also in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Mah\'e4bh\'e4rata }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 it is more elaborately described by Bh\'e9\'f1madeva in the }{
