\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The administrators should never pretend to become nonviolent }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
and thereby go to hell. When Arjuna wanted to become a nonviolent coward in the Battlefield of Kuruk\'f1etra, he was severely chastised by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The Lord degraded Arjuna at that time to the status of an uncivili
zed man for his avowed acceptance of the cult of nonviolence. The administrative class must be personally trained in the military education. Cowards should not be elevated to the presidential throne by dint of numerical votes only. The monarchs were all c
hivalrous personalities, and therefore monarchy should be maintained provided the monarch is regularly trained in the occupational duties of a king. }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
In fighting, the king or the president should never return home without being hurt by the enemy. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The so-call
ed king of today never visits the warfield. He is very much expert in artificially encouraging the fighting strength in the hope of false national prestige. As soon as the administrative class is turned into a gang of mercantile and laborer men, the whole
 machinery of government becomes polluted.
\par The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 vai\'e7yas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
or the mercantile communities are especially advised to protect the cows. Cow protection means increasing the milk productions, namely curd and butter. Agriculture and distribution of the foodstuff are 
the primary duties of the mercantile community backed by education in Vedic knowledge and trained to give in charity. As the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 k\'f1atriyas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
were given charge of the protection of the citizens, }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 vai\'e7yas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 were given the charge of the protection of animals. Animals 
are never meant to be killed. Killing of animals is a symptom of barbarian society. For a human being, agricultural produce, fruits and milk are sufficient and compatible foodstuffs. The human society should give more attention to animal protection. The p
r
oductive energy of the laborer is misused when he is occupied by industrial enterprises. Industry of various types cannot produce the essential needs of man, namely rice, wheat, grains, milk, fruits and vegetables. The production of machines and machine t
ools increases the artificial living fashion of a class of vested interests and keeps thousands of men in starvation and unrest. This should not be the standard of civilization.
\par The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7\'fcdra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 class is less intelligent, and they have no independence. They are me
ant for rendering sincere service to the three higher sections of the society. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7\'fcdra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
class can attain all comforts of life simply by rendering service to the higher classes. It is especially enjoined that a }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7\'fcdra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
should never bank money. As soon as the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e7\'fcdras }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 accumulate wealth, it will be misused for sinful activities in wine, women and gambling. }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Wine, women and gambling indicate that the population is degraded into less than \'e7\'fcdra quality. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
