tuous food and clothing before any sacrifice is performed. In this age so many functions are held by spending millions, }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 but the poor laborer is not sumptuously fed or given charity, clothing, etc. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The laborers are thus dissatisfied, and so they make agitation.
\par The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 var\'ebas }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 are, so to speak, classifications of different occupations, and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e4\'e7rama-dharma }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is gradual progress on the path of self-realization. Both are interrelated, and one is dependent on the other. The main purpose of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e4\'e7rama-dharma }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is to awaken knowledge and detachment. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 brahmac\'e4r\'e9 \'e4\'e7rama }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is the training ground for the prospective candidates. In this}{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592  \'e4\'e7rama }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
it is instructed that this material world is not actually the home of the living being. The conditioned souls under material bondage are prisoners of matter, and therefore self-realization is the ultimate aim of life. The whole system of }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e4\'e7rama-dharma }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is a
