 on charity only, not to accumulate wealth, but just to keep body and soul together for ultimate realization. Household life is for }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 one who is attached, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
and the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 v\'e4naprastha }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 sanny\'e4sa }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
orders of life are for }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 those who are detached }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 from material life. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 brahmac\'e4r\'e9-\'e4\'e7rama }{
