madeva, this illusion was at once removed as soon as the Lord arrived. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is like the sun, and the illusory external material energy is like darkness. In the prese
nce of the sun there is no possibility of darkness standing. Therefore, just on the arrival of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, all material contamination was completely removed, and Bh\'e9\'f1
madeva was thus able to be transcendentally situated by stopping the activities of the imp
ure senses in collaboration with matter. The soul is originally pure and so also the senses. By material contamination the senses assume the role of imperfection and impurity. By revival of contact with the Supreme Pure Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
