\'f1\'ebu in His incarnation appears before us, He seems to be like one of the conditioned souls materially encaged just to bewilder the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 asuras, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
