iples, but he also got approval from his old uncle who was experienced in political affairs, and that was also confirmed by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. the speaker of the philosophy of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.
