d, unfortunate and badly associated. Therefore, they themselves do not know the highest perfectional aim of life. Therefore, votes cast by them actually have no value, and thus persons elected by such irresponsible votes cannot be responsible representati
ves like Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira.
