fficient quantity of grass in the field? Why should men kill cows for their selfish purposes? Why should man not be satisfied with grains, fruits and milk, which, combined together, can produce hundreds and thousands of palatable dishes. Why are there sla
ughterhouses all over the world to kill innocent animals? Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it, grandson of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6
