devotees only. After His separation from V\'e5nd\'e4vana from the innocent rural cowherd boys, girls, ladies and others, they all felt shock throughout their lives, and the separation of R\'e4dh\'e4r\'e4\'eb\'e9
, the most beloved cowherd girl, is beyond expression. Once they met at Kuruk\'f1
etra during a solar eclipse, and the feeling which was expressed by them is heartrending. There is, of course, a difference in the qualities of the transcendental devotees of the Lord, but none of them who have ever contacted the Lord by direct 
communion or otherwise can leave Him for a moment. That is the attitude of the pure devotee.
