e, and again when the time of creation is ripe, I begin creation by the agency of My external energy." (Bg. 9.7)
\par The word }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bh\'fcya\'f9 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
