of the Lord and are forgetful of the sweet relation, are given a chance again to get rid of the clutches of the external energy. And to revive his (the living being's) consciousness, the revealed scriptures are also created by the Lord. Vedic literatures 
are the guiding directions for the conditioned souls so they can get free from the repetition of creation and annihilation of the material world and the material body.
\par The Lord says in the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 "This created world and material energy are under My control. Under the influence of }{
