\par Actually the spiritual spark living entities have no material names or forms. But in order to fulfill
 their desire to lord it over the material energy of material forms and names, they are given a chance for such false enjoyment, and at the same time they are given a chance to understand the real position through the revealed scriptures. The foolish and 
f
orgetful living being is always busy with false forms and false names. Modern nationalism is the culmination of such false names and false forms. Men are mad after false name and form. The form of body obtained under certain conditions is taken up as fact
u
al, and the name also taken bewilders the conditioned soul into misusing the energy in the name of so many "isms." The scriptures, however, supply the clue of understanding the real position, but men are reluctant to take lessons from the scriptures creat
ed by the Lord for different places and times. For example, the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is the guiding principle for every human being, but by the spell of material energy they do not take care to carry out the programs of life in terms of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4. \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam }
{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is the post graduate study of knowledge for one who has thoroughly understood the principles of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4. }{
\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Unfortunately they have no taste for them, and therefore they are under the clutches of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 m\'e4y\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
for repetition of birth and death.
