aged to vanquish them all. He is famous as the Govardhanadh}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid9394938 a}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 r}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid9394938 i}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
