\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 gop\'e9s }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 at V\'e5nd\'e4vana used to think of K\'e5\'f1\'eba while He was away from the village for cowherding engagements, so also the citizens of Dv\'e4rak
\'e4 were all immersed in thought of the Lord while He was away from Dv\'e4rak\'e4 to attend the Battle of Kuruk\'f1etra. Some distinguished fiction writer in Bengal concluded that the K\'e5\'f1\'eba of V\'e5nd\'e4vana, that of Mathuri and that of Dv\'e4
rak\'e4 were different personalities. Historically there is no truth in this conclusion. The K\'e5\'f1\'eba of Kuruk\'f1etra and the K\'e5\'f1\'eba of Dv\'e4rak\'e4 are one and the same personality.
\par The citizens of Dv\'e4rak\'e4 were thus in a state of melancholy due to the Lord's absence from the transcendental city, as much as we are put in a state of melancholy at night because of the absence of the sun. The sound heralded by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a was something like the heralding of the sunrise in the morning. So all the citizens of Dv\'e4rak\'e4 awoke from a state of slumber because of the sunrise of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, and they all hastened towards Him just to have an audience. The devotees of the Lord know no one else as protector.
\par This sound of the Lord is identical with the Lord, as we have tried to explain
 by the nondual position of the Lord. The material existence of our present status is full of fear. Out of the four problems of material existence, namely the food problem, the shelter problem, the fear problem and the mating problem, the fear problem giv
e
s us more trouble than the others. We are always fearful due to our ignorance of the next problem. The whole material existence is full of problems, and thus the fear problem is always prominent. This is due to our association with the illusory energy of 
