or external energy, yet all fear is vanished as soon as there is the sound of the Lord represented by His holy name, as it was sounded by Lord \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu in the following sixteen words: }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare, Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare. }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
