ur eyes. As long as the sunshine is there, our eyes are useful to a certain extent. But in the absence of sunshine, the eyes are useless. Lord \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, being the primeval Lord, the Supreme Truth, is compared to the sun. Without Him all our knowledge is either false or partial. The opposite of the sun is the darkness, and similarly the opposite of K\'e5\'f1\'eba is }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 m\'e4y\'e4, }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or illusion. The devotees of the Lord can see everything in true perspective due to the light disseminated by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
