 to save His beloved devotee Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it. In the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
