\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 arca-vigraha }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 is therefore an all-spiritual form of the Lord to be perceived by the material devotees; such }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
