\par }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592        P\'e4\'eb\'f2ava Arjuna: }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 The great hero of the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4. }{
