alguna (Feb.-March), and therefore he is also called Phalguni. When he appeared as the son of Kunt\'e9
, his future greatness was proclaimed by air messages, and all the important personalities from different parts of the universe, such as the demigods, the Gandharvas, the \'c4dityas (from the sun globe) the Rudras, the }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid16733167 
Vasus}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 , the N\'e4gas and different }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'e5\'f1is }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (sages) of importance, and the Apsar}{
