iva met him. There was a great fight between the two, and at last Lord \'c7iva was satisfied with him and disclosed his identity. Arjuna prayed to the lord in all humbleness, and the lord, being pleased with him, presented him the }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 pa\'e7upata }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 weapon. He acquired many other important weapons from different demigods. He received }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 da\'eb\'f2
\'e4stra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 from Yamar\'e4ja, }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 pa\'e7\'e4stra }{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 from Varu\'eba, and }{
