it wanted to kill the personified Kali who was attempting to kill a cow, the emblem of peace and religion. The symptoms of Kali are 1) wine, 2) women, 3) gambling and 4) slaughter houses. Wise rulers of all states should take lessons from Mah\'e4r\'e4
