one of the great emperors of the world. He reigned over the world long before the reign of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira. He was the son of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Avik\'f1it and was a great devotee of the son of the sun-god, known as Yamar\'e4
