ses are offered at the altar. Such a sacrifice is very costly. Even Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira had to collect the necessary heaps of gold left by Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Marutta and the }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 br\'e4hma\'ebas }{
