a, and all the Vedic literatures give him direction towards that ultimate end. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 confirms this statement (Bg.15.15).
