ga, etc., there are many great devotees, and there are still free kitchen houses for persons who desire to advance spiritually. Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6
hira was inquisitive to learn whether Vidura maintained himself by the mercy of the free kitchen houses }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (chhatras).
