 men to live comfortably at their cost. A }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 s\'e4dhu }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
is to speak to the householders about the naked truth of life so that they may come to their senses about the precarious life in material existence. Dh\'e5tar\'e4\'f1\'f6ra is a typical example of an attached old man in 
household life. He had become a pauper in the true sense, yet he wanted to live comfortably in the house of the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas, of whom Bh\'e9ma especially is mentioned because personally he killed two prominent sons of Dh\'e5tar\'e4\'f1\'f6
ra, namely Duryodhana and Du\'f9\'e7\'e4sana. These two sons were very much dear to him for their notorious and nefarious activities, and Bh\'e9ma is particularly pointed out because he killed these two pet sons. Why was Dh\'e5tar\'e4\'f1\'f6
ra living there at the house of the P\'e4\'eb\'f2avas? Because he wanted to continue his life comfortably, even at the risk of all humiliation. Vidura, therefore, was astonished how powerful is the urge to continue life. This sense of continuing one
\rquote s life indicates that a living being is eternally a living entity, and he does not want t
o change his bodily habitation. The foolish man does not know that a particular term of bodily existence is awarded to him to undergo a term of imprisonment, and the human body is awarded, after many, many births and deaths, as a chance for self-realizati
on to go back home, back to Godhead. But persons like Dh\'e5tar\'e4\'f1\'f6ra try to make plans to live there in a comfortable position with profit and interest, for they do not see things as they are. Dh\'e5tar\'e4\'f1\'f6
ra is blind and continues to hope to live comfortably in the midst of all kinds of reverses of life. A }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 s\'e4dhu }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 
like Vidura is meant to awaken such blind persons and thus help them go back to Godhead, where life is eternal. Once going there, no one wants to come back to this material world of miseries. We can just imagine how responsible a task is entrusted to a }{
\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 s\'e4dhu }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 like Mah\'e4tm\'e4 Vidura.
\par 
