\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 bhakti-yoga }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 all over the world because that alone can save the people from the control of }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 m\'e4y\'e4 }{
\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 or the material nature represented by }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 k\'e4la, karma }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 and }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 gu\'eba, }{
\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 as described above. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 }{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 (Bg. 14.26) confirms this definitely.}{\f35\fs28\insrsid2639816 
