of natural law. The tiger can kill a lower animal for his subsistence, but a man cannot kill an animal for his subsistence. That is the law of God, who has created the law that a living being subsists by eating another living being. Thus the vegetarians a
re also living by eating other living beings. Therefore, the law is that one should live only by eating specific living beings, as ordained by the law of God. The }{\i\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid2639816\charrsid12326592 \'c9\'e7opani\'f1ad}{
